s work item has all required fields with correct values\n- ✓ Follows existing mocking conventions (vi.mock with importOriginal)\n- ✓ Three core tests for findTaskByPrNumber (basic, empty, pagination)\n\n**Existing Behavior Preservation:**\n- ✓ Signature validation untouched\n- ✓ Other event handlers (issues, deployment_status, pull_request_review) unchanged\n- ✓ No weakening of assertions — test updated to match new spec requirement\n\n**Test Results:**\n- ✓ All 738 tests pass, including 26 webhook-handler tests and 48 dynamodb tests\n\n## Minor Observation:\n\nThe existing pull_request test was modified (not extended) to check for `{ status: 'ignored' }` instead of `{ ignored: true }`. This is an intentional response format change explicitly required by the task spec (\"Respond 200 with `{ status: 'ignored' }`\"), so the test assertion update is necessary and correct.\n\n{\"verdict\": \"APPROVE\", \"issues\": []}","reviewVerdict":"APPROVE","reviewIssues":[],"buildGreen":true,"visibleGreen":true,"holdoutPass":true,"holdoutTail":[" Test Files  1 passed (1)","      Tests  3 passed (3)"],"testEdits":["packages/core/__tests__/dynamodb.test.ts","packages/lambdas/__tests__/webhook-handler.test.ts"],"success":true,"silentFailure":false,"blocks":0,"changedFiles":["packages/core/__tests__/dynamodb.test.ts","packages/core/src/dynamodb/task-graphs.ts","packages/lambdas/__tests__/webhook-handler.test.ts","packages/lambdas/src/handlers/webhook-handler.ts"],"diffstat":"4 files changed, 211 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","wallSecTotal":527,"globalCostAfter":58.0401}
{"event":"run","task":"L3","executor":"haiku","plan":"sonnet","arm":"FULL","rep":2,"modelId":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","pinnedSha":"c62bcf6420c24c7e43c078d72aade6afcf25a765","costUsd":0.6635302000000001,"invocations":[{"role":"primary","cost":0.42660400000000004,"turns":37,"wallS":218,"timedOut":false},{"role":"reviewer","cost":0.2369262,"wallS":243}],"contract":{"summary":"Extended GitHub webhook handler to support re-review requests on pull requests. Implemented findTaskByPrNumber helper for task lookup, added pull_request event routing with review_requested action detection, and comprehensive test coverage for wrong actions, unknown PRs, and successful enqueuing.","filesChanged":["packages/core/src/dynamodb/task-graphs.ts","packages/core/__tests__/dynamodb.test.ts","packages/lambdas/src/handlers/webhook-handler.ts","packages/lambdas/__tests__/webhook-handler.test.ts"],"testsGreen":true},"rawReview":"Based on my thorough review of the implementation and tests, I've verified all task requirements:\n\n**Positive findings:**\n1. ✓ `findTaskByPrNumber` helper correctly added to TaskGraphsService with pagination support\n2. ✓ Tests for the helper cover matching task, no match, and pagination cases\n3. ✓ Pull request handler correctly:\n   - Returns 200 with `{ status: 'ignored' }` for non-review_requested actions (line 233)\n   - Returns 200 with `{ status: 'ignored', reason: 'unknown pr' }` for unknown PRs (line 253)\n   - Returns 202 with `{ status: 'queued' }` when task matches (line 271)\n4. ✓ REVIEW_PR work item enqueued with all required fields: type, projectId, repoFullName, taskId, prNumber, correlationId\n5. ✓ Fresh correlationId generated via uuidv4()\n6. ✓ All three required test cases present with proper assertions:\n   - Wrong action ignored (doesn't call findTaskByPrNumber or SQS)\n   - Unknown PR ignored (calls findTaskByPrNumber but not SQS)\n   - Matching PR enqueues exactly one work item and returns 202\n7. ✓ Module-level initialization of TaskGraph